SUMMARY:Davis Farmers Market Picnic In The Park
DESCRIPTION:The popular Davis Farmers Market event is every Wednesday from 4 to 8 p.m.\, April through August. A local band plays each night. There’s children’s entertainment\, loads of food vendors\, and plenty of opportunity to gather as a community. October through April\, there’s a traditional farmers market on Wednesdays\, from 3 to 6 p.m. \nPicnic in the Park focuses on family-friendly children’s activities and music\, along with a wide range of food made from market ingredients. There is a clown\, face-painter and children’s activities. \nYear-round in downtown Davis\, thousands gather each week to shop for what is grown\, raised and made locally. Since 1976\, the Davis Farmers Market has connected and supported communities\, area agriculture\, farmers and artisan food producers. It educates the public about nutrition\, sustainable agriculture\, and the local economic value of buying food and products directly from the producer.
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/davis-farmers-market-picnic-in-the-park-21/2026-07-29/
LOCATION:Central Park\, 301 C Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/486434334_1090519546450339_214190693011889520_n-scaled-Ch1zBz.jpg
END:VEVENT
